# AMMO BLAST: an Ammo store that blows up with its munitions (StructureSystem::ammoBlast; GameMatch emits a few puffs
# through ParticleSystem::emitPuff): a short, bright shower of pale-cyan light shards thrown up and out. `Rate` 0 and
# `Burst` = the puff's particle count (the puff path). Additive and very bright: the bloom takes it.
# Colors are linear HDR (rgb * intensity); the scene tonemaps, so bright additive values glow.
ParticleEffect AmmoBlast
	Emitter Shards
		Texture Textures/Particles/spark.dds
		Rate 0
		Burst 60
		SpawnRadius 1.2
		Offset 0, 0.6, 0
		ConeAngle 160
		Speed 4.0 14.0
		Life 0.5 1.6
		Gravity 6.0
		Drag 1.2
		Turbulence 2.0 1.0 0.5
		Size 0.5 0.1
		SizeVariance 0.5
		VelocityStretch 0.05
		ColorStart 12.0, 30.0, 40.0, 1
		ColorEnd 2.0, 6.0, 10.0, 0
		Additivity 1
		FadeIn 0.01
		FadeOutStart 0.4
		SoftFade 0.1
